{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\n\t\t\t中國空間站舉行航天員在軌交接儀式，神舟二十三號向神舟二十四號航天員移交中國空間站的鎖匙。<br/>\n<br/>\n香港航天員黎家盈等三名航天員，將於近日搭乘飛船返回東風著陸場，神舟二十四號乘組特別為黎家盈和香港送上祝福。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n編輯：詹可揚\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-28T12:09:14.144463+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":105,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-28T11:43:50+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T13:12:41.740735+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-28T12:02:50.038261+00:00","content_hash":"08b4d0a3cd6250b415c73ab9abd6ba92a8f075bbfc752bd92b452648708e31a4","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}